# General provenance

Gist Registry is authored by Vikrant Varun Kudesia and maintained by Driftframe
Studios, Limited Liability Company. Vikrant sets the work's direction and
retains human authorship and publication authority.

Human–AI collaboration describes the arrangement of work: generative AI
systems assist with research, drafting, code generation, and checks within
assigned tasks and available tools. People hold the consequential review,
acceptance, and publication decisions; authorized systems can carry out their
specified actions. Runnable source, focused observations, and reviewed pull
requests establish the technical evidence. Git history and reviewed pull
requests carry contribution credit.

This repository-wide record lets individual samples stay focused on technical
material. Copyright notices remain in their established repository and page
carriers.
